    "Clasificación": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leaderboard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En las zonas a ciegas los muros no se ven: el ritmo de las vibraciones dice a qué distancia está el muro, y una textura continua avisa de que pasas por el hueco.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In blind zones the walls are invisible: the rhythm of the vibrations tells you how far away the wall is, and a continuous texture warns you when you're passing through the gap."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hápticos": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Haptics"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jugar": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumi Swing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lumi Swing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mantén pulsado para agarrarte a una flor.\nSuelta para salir volando.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold to grab onto a flower.\nLet go to fly off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Menú": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
